   <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inWorld> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/graph/alignments> ;
   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "the independent purrdf entailment cross-check validates the native result; native gaps fail"@en .
